                             "description":  "Heroin (Diacetylmorphine) is a semi-synthetic opioid derived from morphine. It is classified as a manufactured narcotic drug under the Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances (NDPS) Act, 1985. Unauthorized production, possession, sale, purchase, transport, storage and distribution are prohibited except where permitted for medical or scientific purposes."
